    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Calculators </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Crypto</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Free calculator</p>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Crypto tax calculator</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Every crypto disposal is a CGT event — including a swap. Enter the parcel and see what the gain costs you at your marginal rate.</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft mt-4\"> Updated for 2024–25, 2025–26, 2026–27 · verified against <a href=\"https://www.ato.gov.au/tax-rates-and-codes/tax-rates-australian-residents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ato.gov.au</a> on 2026-08-21 · some 2026–27 thresholds are provisional pending ATO indexation </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"GainsCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{&quot;variant&quot;:&quot;crypto&quot;}\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">What you sold or swapped it for (AUD)</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_2l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"30,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Use the AUD value at the time of the disposal. Swapping one coin for another is a disposal.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">What it cost you</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_4l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"12,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Purchase price in AUD plus exchange fees on both sides.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I held it for more than 12 months</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Twelve months and one day qualifies for the 50% discount. Twelve months exactly does not.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_6l_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\" checked=\"\"/></div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Capital losses you can use</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_8l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Losses from this year or carried forward from earlier years.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_al_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Your other income for the year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_al_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"90,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Salary and everything else. The gain is taxed on top of this, at your marginal rate.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_cl_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Financial year of the sale</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_cl_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\" selected=\"\">2025–26</option><option value=\"2026-27\">2026–27</option></select></div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">The CGT event happens on the contract date, not settlement.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Capital gains</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2025–26</span></div>\n<div class=\"tally-print\">\n<div data-tally-line=\"proceeds\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Disposal proceeds</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$30,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"cost-base\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less cost base</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$12,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"gross-gain\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Capital gain</span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$18,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"discount\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less 50% CGT discount</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$9,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"net-gain\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Net capital gain added to your income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$9,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"tax\" class=\"px-4 py-5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Tax on the gain</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">The extra tax the gain causes, including the Medicare levy — a capital gain has no rate of its own.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-owing)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$2,880</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">Tax on the gain<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$2,880</span></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$22,468 with the gain − $19,588 without</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"/lodge/?income=90000&amp;gain=9000&amp;fy=2025-26\" class=\"block rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Have an agent handle the gain</a></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not tax advice. Main residence, small business and rollover concessions are not modelled here.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Tax on the gain</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-owing)]\">$2,880</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/lodge/\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p><!--astro:end--></div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"prose-statement\">\n<h2>What counts as a disposal</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Selling crypto for Australian dollars</li>\n<li>Swapping one cryptocurrency for another, including stablecoins</li>\n<li>Using crypto to buy goods or services</li>\n<li>Gifting it to someone</li>\n</ul>\n<p> Transferring between your own wallets is not a disposal. Neither is buying and holding. But every one of the four above needs an Australian dollar value recorded at the moment it happened, which is why exchange records matter more in crypto than in almost any other asset class. </p>\n<h2>Parcels, not balances</h2>\n<p> CGT applies to each parcel you bought, not to your holding as a whole. If you bought Bitcoin three times at different prices and sold part of it, you need to identify which parcel you sold. You can choose the method, but you must apply it consistently and be able to show your working. This calculator handles one parcel at a time — for a year of trading, an agent working from your exchange export is faster and considerably safer. </p>\n<h2>Investor or trader</h2>\n<p> An investor holds crypto for capital growth and pays CGT with access to the 50% discount. A trader carries on a business of trading, treats crypto as trading stock, pays tax on the full profit as ordinary income, and can deduct losses against other income. Which one you are is a question of fact, not a choice — frequency, volume, intention and business-like organisation all count. Most people are investors, and the ATO will say so if you have claimed otherwise without the substance to back it. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-crypto-tax-calculator-heading\">\n<h2 id=\"faq-crypto-tax-calculator-heading\" class=\"text-2xl\">Questions people actually ask</h2>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Do I pay tax on crypto in Australia?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes. The ATO treats crypto as property, not currency, so disposing of it is a CGT event. Selling for dollars, swapping one coin for another, spending it on goods and gifting it are all disposals. Simply holding it is not.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Is swapping one coin for another taxable?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes, and it is the most commonly missed event. Swapping BTC for ETH is a disposal of the BTC at its Australian dollar value at that moment, whether or not any dollars change hands.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Does the ATO know about my crypto?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Almost certainly. Australian exchanges report to the ATO under the data-matching program, covering millions of accounts. Unreported disposals are one of the most common triggers for a review.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">What if I made a loss?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">A crypto loss is a capital loss. It cannot reduce your salary income, but it offsets capital gains this year and carries forward indefinitely against future gains. It is worth recording even in a year where you have no gains.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Do I get the 50% discount on crypto?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes, if you held the particular parcel more than 12 months and you are an individual holding as an investor. Crypto held as trading stock by a genuine trading business is treated as ordinary income instead, with no discount.</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Read up first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/tax-tips/what-can-i-claim/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\">What can I claim on tax?</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">A plain guide to work-related tax deductions in Australia: what qualifies, what does not, what records you need, and what each claim is actually worth.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-dark\">\n<div class=\"cta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p>\n<h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2>\n<p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"/lodge/\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec\">\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Registered tax agent</span><b>26233684</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee deductible from refund</span><i>included</i></div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Other calculators</h2>\n<p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">All calculators →</a> </div>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Income tax </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Your tax, Medicare levy, study loan repayment and take-home pay for any income, in any of the last three financial years.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-refund-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Tax refund </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/calculators/capital-gains-tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Capital gains </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">What you will pay on a share, property or crypto sale — with the 50% discount and any carried-forward losses applied in the right order.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/GainsCalculator.js\" defer></script></p>\n"
